0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">「</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">유네스코 활동에 관한 법률</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">」</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">에 따라 대한민국에서 유네스코</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(UNESCO: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">국제연합교육과학문화기구</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">활동을 촉진하는 공공단체로서</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">국내외 청년들의 상호 이해 증진과 세계시민 의식 함양을 위해 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1960</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">년대부터 유네스코 국제워크캠프를 개최하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p 